{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%@ Drag Mac-Monologue into the Applications folder in Finder instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ Zieh Mac-Monologue stattdessen im Finder in den Ordner „Programme“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ — unavailable": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ – nicht verbunden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@, %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld seconds": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld Sekunden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%%": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld %%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new version of Mac-Monologue is available": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine neue Version von Mac-Monologue ist verfügbar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A video or music playing on your Mac gets quieter whenever you speak, and comes back when you pause. The fader in the main window sets how loud it is otherwise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Video oder Musik auf deinem Mac wird leiser, sobald du sprichst, und kommt in Sprechpausen zurück. Der Regler im Hauptfenster bestimmt, wie laut es sonst ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access needed": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zugriff nötig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add subtitles in": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Untertitel hinzufügen in"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding them to the video": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Werden ins Video eingefügt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After each take, your Mac can write down what you said and add it as subtitles, in the language you speak and translated. Viewers switch them on in their player, and each language is also saved as a file for YouTube or Vimeo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach jeder Aufnahme kann dein Mac aufschreiben, was du gesagt hast, und es als Untertitel hinzufügen – in deiner Sprache und übersetzt. Zuschauer schalten sie im Player ein, und jede Sprache wird zusätzlich als Datei für YouTube oder Vimeo gespeichert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ erlauben …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowed": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erlaubt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another app already uses this combination. Choose a different one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine andere App nutzt diese Kombination schon. Wähle eine andere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks GitHub for the newest version when Mac-Monologue opens and once a day. Nothing else leaves your Mac, and nothing is installed without asking you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fragt beim Öffnen und einmal am Tag bei GitHub nach der neuesten Version. Sonst verlässt nichts deinen Mac, und nichts wird ohne deine Zustimmung installiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatisch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic uses a green screen when it sees one behind you, and Apple's person detection otherwise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatisch nutzt einen Greenscreen, wenn einer hinter dir zu sehen ist, und sonst Apples Personenerkennung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatically check for updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatisch nach Updates suchen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
