      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im Fenster von Mac-Monologue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In use": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktiv"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install and Relaunch": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installieren und neu starten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed version": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installierte Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing — Mac-Monologue will reopen by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird installiert – Mac-Monologue öffnet sich danach von selbst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is running from %@. Updates can only be installed in Applications, and it is easy to find there. It opens again right away.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die App läuft aus „%@“. Updates lassen sich nur im Ordner „Programme“ installieren, und dort findest du sie leicht. Sie öffnet sich sofort wieder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Just you, through the camera.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur du, über die Kamera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Just your screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur dein Bildschirm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Behalten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep me in frame": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im Bild bleiben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps it off the slides you are presenting. It is never in the recording either way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Damit es nicht über deinen Folien liegt. In der Aufnahme ist es so oder so nie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyboard Shortcuts": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tastenkürzel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Large": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Groß"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last checked": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zuletzt geprüft"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Later": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Später"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let go → you, full frame": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loslassen → du im Vollbild"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listening to the take": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Aufnahme wird angehört"
          }
        }
      }
