    "Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Updates"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updating Mac-Monologue": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac-Monologue wird aktualisiert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ verwenden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use at least two of ⌃ ⌥ ⇧ ⌘ together with one key, so the shortcut cannot go off while typing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nimm mindestens zwei von ⌃ ⌥ ⇧ ⌘ zusammen mit einer Taste, damit das Kürzel beim Tippen nicht versehentlich auslöst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses this camera's Center Stage: it follows you as you move, at full sharpness. You can also switch it in Control Center.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nutzt den Folgemodus dieser Kamera: Er folgt dir bei voller Schärfe. Du kannst ihn auch im Kontrollzentrum schalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ is the newest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@ ist die neueste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ — you have %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@ – du hast %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Very high": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sehr hoch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stimme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice and Mac sound balance": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verhältnis von Stimme und Mac-Ton"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Mac-Monologue": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Willkommen bei Mac-Monologue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Mac-Monologue…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Willkommen bei Mac-Monologue …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Mac-Monologue opens": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim Öffnen von Mac-Monologue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you present, your slides are in front. These keys still reach Mac-Monologue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Während du präsentierst, sind deine Folien vorne. Diese Tasten erreichen Mac-Monologue trotzdem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing the file failed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Schreiben der Datei ist fehlgeschlagen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change them later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du kannst sie später in den Einstellungen ändern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change this any time in Settings › Subtitles.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du kannst das jederzeit unter Einstellungen › Untertitel ändern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change this any time, in the main window or in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du kannst das jederzeit ändern, im Hauptfenster oder in den Einstellungen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have version %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast Version %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You, cut out": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du, freigestellt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You, cut out, standing in front of your screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du, freigestellt, vor deinem Bildschirm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You, full frame": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du im Vollbild"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your position on the screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Position auf dem Bildschirm"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your screen while a finger rests on the trackpad, you in full frame once you let go.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Bildschirm, solange ein Finger auf dem Trackpad liegt – du im Vollbild, sobald du loslässt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your screen, with you in a round bubble in a corner.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Bildschirm, mit dir in einer runden Blase in der Ecke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your screen, you in the bubble": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Bildschirm, du in der Blase"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your size": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Größe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your voice as it goes into the recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Stimme, wie sie in die Aufnahme geht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zooms in slightly": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoomt leicht hinein"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "about %lld minutes left": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "noch etwa %lld Minuten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "about 1 minute left": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "noch etwa 1 Minute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "as spoken": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "wie gesprochen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "both full": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "beide voll"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "less than a minute left": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "noch weniger als eine Minute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS only lets Mac-Monologue see your screen after it restarts. It takes a second and opens again right away.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS lässt Mac-Monologue deinen Bildschirm erst nach einem Neustart sehen. Das dauert eine Sekunde, die App öffnet sich sofort wieder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS will send you to System Settings: switch on Mac-Monologue under “Screen & System Audio Recording”, then come back here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS schickt dich in die Systemeinstellungen: Schalte Mac-Monologue unter „Bildschirm- & Systemaudioaufnahme“ ein und komm dann hierher zurück."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "translated": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "übersetzt"
          }
        }
      }
